    "name": "Soda Cloud REST Attributes Incidents API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Soda Cloud REST API enables programmatic access to trigger data quality scans, retrieve check results, update incident status, manage datasets, datasources, contracts, runners, secrets, notification rules, and integrate data quality workflows into CI/CD pipelines. Supports EU and US cloud regions.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Soda Support",
